description = "A seat on the ship's axis and a quiver of three lances. Arm it, then ram: at 120 m/s or more, square-on, a lance strikes for heavy damage and stays in the target; the next slides in a few seconds later. Slower or oblique, it glances off. Lances are restocked at the home station."
